sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant NodeLibrary
    participant CanvasArea
    participant PipelineNode
    participant PipelineEditorStore
    participant ConfigPanel

    User->>NodeLibrary: 点击/拖拽节点类型
    NodeLibrary->>PipelineEditorStore: addNode(type, position)
    PipelineEditorStore-->>CanvasArea: pipelineNodes 更新
    CanvasArea->>PipelineNode: 渲染新节点

    User->>PipelineNode: 点击节点
    PipelineNode->>PipelineEditorStore: selectNode(nodeId)
    PipelineEditorStore->>ConfigPanel: selectedNode computed 变化
    ConfigPanel->>ConfigPanel: 渲染 5 个 section

    User->>ConfigPanel: 编辑提示词
    ConfigPanel->>PipelineEditorStore: updateNodeConfig(nodeId, { prompt })
    PipelineEditorStore->>PipelineEditorStore: configDirty = true

    Note over User,PipelineEditorStore: --- 连线操作 ---

    User->>PipelineNode: 点击 cn-out 连接器
    PipelineNode->>PipelineEditorStore: startConnect(sourceId)
    PipelineEditorStore->>PipelineEditorStore: connectMode=true, connectSource=sourceId

    User->>PipelineNode: 点击另一节点的 cn-in
    PipelineNode->>PipelineEditorStore: completeConnect(targetId)
    PipelineEditorStore->>PipelineEditorStore: connections.push({sourceId, targetId})
    PipelineEditorStore->>PipelineEditorStore: connectMode=false
